  "rationale": "The plant models the robot's motion and perception interface, with open-loop motion pulses and sensor events. The specification enforces always-turn-right recovery, disables forward motion when any obstacle is present, and ensures the robot returns to forward exploration as soon as the path is clear. Only rotate_clockwise is used for turning or recovery. All uncontrollable events are handled deterministically, and the supervisor is biased toward forward progress while prioritizing safety.",
  "strategy": [
    "Model robot's motion and perception as a single plant automaton with explicit commit states for each action.",
    "Specification automaton enforces: (1) move_forward only in clear state, (2) rotate_clockwise as the only recovery/turn action, (3) immediate return to forward progress after path_clear, (4) no forward motion in any obstacle state."
